== Description ==
The [[:Category:Tier_2_Pets|Tier 2]] version of {{PetTooltip|pet_name=Golem}}.

Increases profits with [[Experience#Wizard_Experience|character experience]] and amount of [[Exile|Exiles]]. Increases [[:Category:Incantation Spells|Incantation]] efficiency.

Experience gained per second depends on number of [[upgrades]] bought.

== Pet Ability ==

Multiplies profits by:
<br><math>X^{0.34} \times L \times P \times (E^{0.1} + 1) \times 0.065 + 1</math>


Multiplies Incantation efficiency by:
<br><math>L \times 0.025 + 1</math>


where:
*<math>X = \text{Total Character Experience}</math>
*<math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
*<math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>
*<math>E = \text{Total Exiles}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
Gains gains experience each second, equal to:
<br><math>\left( U^{0.5} \times 0.5 + F \right) \times M</math>
<br>where:
*<math>U = \text{Bought Upgrades}</math>
*<math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
*<math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>

